. **********************************************************************
. **# 4 - Table 2: Benchmark Tests ($2.50)
. **********************************************************************
. 
. /*
> Table 2 notes:
> 
> Benchmark test:
> H0: mean WTP after magnesium information = 2.50
> H1: mean WTP after magnesium information ≠ 2.50
> 
> The benchmark price is $2.50 for a typical 20-oz sports beverage.
> 
> after_584 = WTP after magnesium information for Product 584
> after_793 = WTP after magnesium information for Product 793
> 
> Alpha = 0.05.
> If p < 0.05, reject H0.
> */
. 
. use "$logs/day1_clean.dta", clear
{txt}
{com}. 
. tempname memhold
{txt}
{com}. postfile `memhold' str40 product mean tstat pvalue ci_low ci_high using "$logs/table2_benchmark.dta", replace
{txt}
{com}. 
. ttest after_584 == 2.5

{txt}One-sample t test
{hline 9}{c TT}{hline 68}
Variable{col 10}{c |}{col 16}Obs{col 27}Mean{col 35}Std. err.{col 47}Std. dev.{col 59}[95% conf. interval]
{hline 9}{c +}{hline 68}
