{txt}{hline 9}{c BT}{hline 68}
    mean = mean({res}after_584{txt})                                        t = {res}  5.0514
{txt}H0: mean = {res}2.5                                   {txt}Degrees of freedom = {res}      69

   {txt}Ha: mean < {res}2.5               {txt}Ha: mean != {res}2.5               {txt}Ha: mean > {res}2.5
 {txt}Pr(T < t) = {res}1.0000         {txt}Pr(|T| > |t|) = {res}0.0000          {txt}Pr(T > t) = {res}0.0000
{txt}
{com}. post `memhold' ("UA Lemon Lime (584)") (r(mu_1)) (r(t)) (r(p)) (r(lb_1)) (r(ub_1))
{txt}
{com}. 
. ttest after_793 == 2.5

